1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:07,300
Maybe I'm your father, maybe I'm your friend

2
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:13,860
Maybe I'm the voice you lost and would give anything to hear again

3
00:00:15,940 --> 00:00:18,420
And hear me say I love you

4
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:21,460
And I'm proud of who you are

5
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:25,140
I'm closer than you think I am

6
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:28,980
I was never very far

7
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:33,780
Let your eyes fall closed a while

8
00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:37,380
Let the heavy feeling go

9
00:00:38,260 --> 00:00:42,340
Feel my arms around your shoulders

10
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:45,780
I'm right here, you know

11
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:48,740
You don't have to hurt forever

12
00:00:49,380 --> 00:00:51,940
That was never what I'd want

13
00:00:53,380 --> 00:00:56,100
As long as I'm remembered

14
00:00:57,940 --> 00:01:01,620
I'm never really gone
